 (item 13, complete)

Added the shared DeleteAccountSection to dealer, partner, super-admin
settings, and user profile. Confirmed staff needed no separate edit
at all - staff/settings already reuses the exact dealer settings
component via dynamic import, and no separate staff profile page
exists, so all 5 roles are now covered with these 4 changes.

Real pre-existing bug found (not caused by this change, left alone
since it's out of scope here): the user profile page's notifications
section is duplicated in the file, with one copy incorrectly sitting
inside the page's loading-spinner return block. Made sure to target
only the real, second occurrence precisely - using unique surrounding
context - so the new Delete Account section didn't end up placed
inside the loading state too.

Item 13 is now fully complete: every role can delete their own
account from settings, with password + typed confirmation, landing
on a soft delete that preserves all history for Super Admin per item
14, then logs the person out immediately.
